Students often need quick information about colleges, such as fees, ratings, placement percentage, salary, hostel fees, entrance exams, safety, and other frequently asked details.
Manually searching through different sources or datasets for this information can be time-consuming.
This project aims to develop an AI-based college FAQ chatbot that understands a user's question, identifies the required information using intent classification, and retrieves the relevant college details from a structured dataset.
The chatbot provides a simple and quick way for students to obtain frequently requested college information through natural-language questions.
